 SMTC. Do not take that trade on the headline, because the draft has not resolved the one question that decides it: does the rule follow the COMPANY or the COUNTRY OF MANUFACTURE? Cignal AI, Aug 2026: 'unknown'. If it follows the company, InnoLight routes around it \u2014 it is already building in Thailand and Indonesia and sells non-Chinese output under the TeraHop brand \u2014 and the ban is largely cosmetic. If it follows the place of production, which is the test the FCC used for robots and inverters on Jul 28, then the replacements are caught too: Coherent manufactures in China, and Lumentum's North American assembly is ramping in THAILAND, as is Fabrinet's entire model. The only listed capacity that clears an origin test outright is AAOI's Sugar Land and Pearland build-out, live from summer 2026 \u2014 and Cignal judges AAOI too small to fill the gap. Both branches therefore end in shortage and cost inflation for the hyperscalers rather than clean substitution. Second-guessing the scope is the highest-value work on this lever; the beneficiary list is worthless until it resolves.","hits":"opt, net"},{"d":"2027-01-14","type":"earnings","tk":"TSM","n":"TSMC","conv":3,"froth":1,"eps":5.16,"eps_lo":5.1,"eps_hi":5.28,"dd":-20.0,"ts":1799933400,"when":"pre","xt":"08:30 EST"},{"d":"2027-01-21","type":"earnings","tk":"009150.KS","n":"Samsung Electro-Mechanics","conv":2,"froth":1,"eps":8741.26,"eps_lo":8280.89,"eps_hi":9059.15,"dd":-61.2,"ts":1800511200,"when":"during","xt":"15:00 KST"},{"d":"2027-01-26","type":"earnings","tk":"4063.T","n":"Shin-Etsu Chemical","conv":2,"froth":1,"dd":-27.0,"ts":1800945000,"when":"post","xt":"15:30 JST"},{"d":"2027-01-26","type":"earnings","tk":"6239.TW","n":"Powertech (PTI)","conv":2,"froth":1,"eps":4.0,"eps_lo":3.5,"eps_hi":4.81,"dd":-37.7,"ts":1800941400,"when":"post","xt":"13:30 CST"},{"d":"2027-01-26","type":"earnings","tk":"GLW","n":"Corning","conv":2,"froth":2,"eps":0.97,"eps_lo":0.9,"eps_hi":0.99,"dd":-54.6,"ts":1800970200,"when"